  "notes": [
    "Reset: the adapters were deployed and set as BOO's oracle source first; the BOO reserve was only activated (initReserve with its pToken, LTV 55%) 25 minutes later. The exploit needed both, and a market listing is a HIGH config, so the listing sets the age.",
    "The Multichain-bridged SOL token has no market price (its bridge backing failed in 2023) and is listed at zero; at native SOL's price it would add about 102,539 USD.",
    "Fantom has no Etherscan v2 API; contracts are unverified, so the mechanism rests on the call trace and pool-balance arithmetic, and deployments were found by getCode binary search."
